<title>POLAND: Polish c.banker sees zloty up after rate rise.</title>
<headline>Polish c.banker sees zloty up after rate rise.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The zloty, hit by the impact of floods on  the economy and uninspiring current account data, is likely to get  a boost from the central bank's interest rate rise on August 4, the  president of the National Bank of Poland said on Friday.</p>
</text>
